WEBVTT

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:02.120
Welcome to ASH Workspace Gold.

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:08.660
Contracts, emails, invoices, photos, deadlines, and
various statements can quickly become overwhelming.

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:15.300
ASH Workspace Gold brings all this information
together in a secure digital workspace.

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:22.250
You describe a case in writing or via microphone, take
photos, scan, or upload documents, and assign

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.460
everything to the correct process.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:30.750
The application recognizes and structures content,
checks document quality, and highlights gaps,

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.620
contradictions, and evidence.

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:37.480
Risks are displayed in an
easy-to-understand traffic light system.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:42.140
Deadlines, next steps, and the processing
history remain fully traceable.

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:49.040
For cross-border processes, home country, destination
country, and legal jurisdictions can be compared on a

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.240
case-by-case basis.

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:53.980
Sources and unverified points are clearly marked.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:57.970
Response letters can be prepared
in two freely chosen languages.

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:02.910
Interface, input, and output
are configured independently.

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:08.020
Results can be exported as P-D-F,
Word, Excel, or PowerPoint.

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:14.090
Before saving, exporting, or sharing, you see a
full preview and make the final decision yourself.

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:18.350
Data protection and A-I permissions
remain under your control.

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:25.860
ASH Workspace Gold is not a substitute for personal
advice from lawyers, authorities, or other professional

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:26.300
bodies.

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:33.470
It helps you consolidate documents in an organized way,
understand the facts, and prepare concrete next steps.

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:37.960
You can start with three documents for free,
with no automatic renewal.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.350
Only when you need more do you transparently
choose a suitable product tier.

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:49.520
ASH Workspace Gold: clarity, control,
and understandable results in one workspace.